      "html": "<article class=\"ds-clip ds-current\"><input class=\"ds-keep\" type=\"checkbox\" checked aria-label=\"保留片段 1\"><button class=\"ds-clip-main\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"查看片段 1\"><span class=\"ds-clip-time\">1 / 0.70 — 8.80 s</span><p class=\"ds-transcript\">虚构示例：先听一句，再决定留下什么。</p><p class=\"ds-clip-note\">demo_001.mp4</p></button><div class=\"ds-move\"><button class=\"ds-move-button\" disabled aria-label=\"上移片段 1\">上移</button><button class=\"ds-move-button\" aria-label=\"下移片段 1\">下移</button></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-clip{font:16px/1.6 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#222a40);display:grid;grid-template-columns:26px minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:12px;padding:20px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#d8dce6);border-radius:0;transition:background .2s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-current{background:var(--selection,#eeebf9)}.ds-keep{width:18px;height:18px;accent-color:var(--blue,#284eab);margin-top:7px;cursor:pointer}.ds-clip-main{font:16px/1.6 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#222a40);border:0;border-radius:7px;text-align:left;padding:0;line-height:1.7;min-width:0;min-height:44px;align-self:start;cursor:pointer}.ds-clip-main:hover{background:transparent}.ds-clip-time{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#596176);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin-bottom:6px}.ds-transcript{margin:0;font-size:15px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;max-width:70ch}.ds-clip-note{margin:6px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#596176)}.ds-move{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}.ds-move-button{font:16px/1.6 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;border:1px solid var(--line,#d8dce6);border-radius:7px;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#222a40);padding:9px 16px;cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;transition:background .16s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)),border-color .16s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-move-button:hover{background:#e9edf7;border-color:#9ca8c7}.ds-move-button:disabled{background:#ebeef4;color:#667086;cursor:not-allowed;border-color:var(--line,#d8dce6)}.ds-move-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--purple,#584aa3);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-move-button{transition:none!important}}.ds-move .ds-move-button{padding:4px 8px;min-height:36px;font-size:12px;background:transparent}.ds-clip-main:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--purple,#584aa3);outline-offset:3px}.ds-keep:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--purple,#584aa3);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-clip{padding:18px 4px;gap:8px}.ds-move .ds-move-button{padding:4px 6px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-clip{transition:none!important}}"
