      "description": "紫色项代表保留，描边代表当前；容器横向滚动，文字单行省略。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-strip\" aria-label=\"已选片段顺序\"><button class=\"ds-timeline-item\" aria-current=\"true\">1 / 8.10 s<span class=\"ds-timeline-text\">虚构示例片段</span></button><button class=\"ds-timeline-item\" aria-current=\"false\">2 / 9.90 s<span class=\"ds-timeline-text\">另一段虚构示例</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-strip{display:flex;gap:8px;overflow-x:auto;padding:3px 3px 14px;min-height:70px}.ds-timeline-item{font:16px/1.6 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;border:1px solid var(--line,#d8dce6);border-radius:7px;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#222a40);padding:9px 16px;cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;transition:background .16s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)),border-color .16s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-timeline-item:hover{background:#e9edf7;border-color:#9ca8c7}.ds-timeline-item:disabled{background:#ebeef4;color:#667086;cursor:not-allowed;border-color:var(--line,#d8dce6)}.ds-timeline-item:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--purple,#584aa3);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-timeline-item{transition:none!important}}.ds-timeline-item{flex:0 0 144px;text-align:left;background:var(--selection,#eeebf9);color:var(--purple,#584aa3);border:0;font-size:12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-timeline-item:hover{background:var(--selection,#eeebf9)}.ds-timeline-item[aria-current=true]{outline:2px solid var(--purple,#584aa3);outline-offset:0}.ds-timeline-text{display:block;white-space:nowrap;text-overflow:ellipsis;overflow:hidden;max-width:116px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "未关联试听面板",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "preview-panel",
      "description": "白色工作面及媒体空态；点阵仅为空态，未关联时试听禁用。这里展示结构，不加载文件。",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-preview-panel\" aria-label=\"片段试听\"><div class=\"ds-preview\"><div class=\"ds-media-empty\"><div class=\"ds-empty-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"ds-preview-copy\">选择源视频后试听</p></div></div><p class=\"ds-source\">demo_001.mp4</p><div class=\"ds-media-actions\"><button class=\"ds-media-button\">关联源视频</button><button class=\"ds-media-button\" disabled>试听片段</button></div><p class=\"ds-media-state\" role=\"status\">仅在当前页面读取，不上传。</p></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-preview-panel{font:16px/1.6 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#222a40);position:sticky;top:24px;background:var(--surface,#fff);padding:24px;border-radius:var(--radius,12px)}.ds-preview{background:#e3e6ef;border-radius:var(--radius,12px);overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:16/9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.ds-media-empty{text-align:center}.ds-empty-mark{width:74px;height:48px;margin:0 auto 20px;background:radial-gradient(circle,var(--purple,#584aa3) 1.5px,transparent 2px);background-size:12px 12px;opacity:.5}.ds-preview-copy{margin:0;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted,#596176)}.ds-source{overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted,#596176);margin:16px 0 12px}.ds-media-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-media-state{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#596176);margin:10px 0 20px}.ds-media-button{font:16px/1.6 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;border:1px solid var(--line,#d8dce6);border-radius:7px;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#222a40);padding:9px 16px;cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;transition:background .16s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)),border-color .16s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-media-button:hover{background:#e9edf7;border-color:#9ca8c7}.ds-media-button:disabled{background:#ebeef4;color:#667086;cursor:not-allowed;border-color:var(--line,#d8dce6)}.ds-media-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--purple,#584aa3);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-media-button{transition:none!important}}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-preview-panel{position:static;padding:20px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "品牌入口",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "brand-link",
      "description": "页头只有品牌返回与本地说明，未实现独立导航菜单。",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-header\"><a class=\"ds-brand\" href=\"/\">RoughCut <span class=\"ds-brand-caption\">审核台</span></a><span class=\"ds-local\">素材留在本机</span></header>",
      "css": ".ds-header{font:16px/1.6 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;max-width:1360px;margin:auto;padding:24px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#d8dce6)}.ds-brand{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink,#222a40);letter-spacing:-.02em}.ds-brand-caption{font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:var(--muted,#596176);margin-left:12px}.ds-local{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted,#596176)}.ds-brand:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--purple,#584aa3);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-header{padding:20px}.ds-brand{font-size:20px}.ds-brand-caption{margin-left:8px}.ds-local{font-size:11px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "切点局部错误",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "local-error",
      "description": "错误靠近相关操作并有 status 语义；普通态由 notice 清掉 error class。",
      "html": "<p class=\"ds-trim-status ds-error\" role=\"status\">切点无效：入点应小于出点，且不能超出源视频。</p>",
      "css": ".ds-trim-status{font:14px/1.6 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#222a40);margin:12px 0 0;min-height:22px;max-width:70ch}.ds-trim-status.ds-error{color:#9b263c}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "字幕校对表",
    "overview": "冷灰底承接连续转写，白色工作面容纳试听和切点输入；蓝色用于推进操作，紫色用于辨认当前片段。界面把文字、时间和决定放在一起，让用户逐句阅读、试听与修改。它的细节来自校对工作的对齐和留白，不模拟纸张纹理或机械设备。\n\n系统字体、原生复选框、数字输入、视频控件和浏览器确认框构成实际交互语言，无外部字体下载。视觉状态应始终能对应真实审核状态；示例标明虚构，导出 CSV 后仍说明尚未生成视频。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "连续文本行与精确时间优先于装饰。",
      "冷灰底、白色工作面、蓝色动作与紫色当前态各有职责。",
      "通过色面和细线分层，没有阴影与无限动画。",
      "就地反馈和可恢复操作支撑持续审核。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The State Color Rule",
        "body": "蓝色表达操作，紫色表达当前定位；错误同时写出问题与恢复方式，不仅改变颜色。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Timing Rule",
        "body": "正文保持自然系统字形；需要比较的数字启用等宽数字，不把整个审核台切换成代码编辑器字体。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Surface Rule",
        "body": "层级依靠色面、分隔线与留白，当前态依靠选择底色或描边，不添加装饰阴影。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** 让时间、正文、保留选择和来源在同一连续行中可对照。",
      "**Do** 沿用蓝色动作、紫色当前态和冷灰阅读环境。",
      "**Do** 使用离线可用的系统字体，并仅对需要对齐的数字启用 tabular-nums。",
      "**Do** 把媒体、切点和导出反馈留在对应操作旁，并在状态变化时清理旧提示。",
      "**Do** 保留原生控件、清晰焦点、可取消替换和显式保存会话。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** 用独立卡片网格替换候选连续行，或用阴影与装饰转移对文字和切点的注意。",
      "**Don't** 把当前查看等同于已保留，或把先前导出等同于当前修改已经核对。",
      "**Don't** 把示例、待关联媒体、未测试的状态或 CSV 导出表现为真实成片结果。",
      "**Don't** 引入外部字体依赖、无限动画或未经实现验证的通用组件规则。",
      "**Don't** 将限定修复清单的 ship 结论扩写为整个产品已经验收。"
    ]
  }
}
